      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.DbClient.RowFailedEventArgs<TRecord>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.DbClient.RowFailedEventArgs-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Payload for <code>DbLoader{TRecord}.RowFailed</code>. Fires once per row that\nfailed to load when <code>ErrorHandling</code> is <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.DbClient.RowErrorHandling.Skip\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.</p>\n"
    },
